TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Haklısın;{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} hediyenin nasıl
verildiğine takılmayayım{{TAG:0000:0004:}}.
Getirdiğin için sağ ol {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ah, never mind!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's the thought
that counts, not the wrapping.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sorry you got dragged into all this.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Thanks! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, ¡qué más da!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Lo que cuenta
es la intención, no el envoltorio.{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Oye, perdona por el follón, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Hein ? C'est toi qui l'as ouvert ?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bah alors{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Faut pas s'gêner, hein !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
T'aurais au moins pu essayer d'faire
en sorte que ça s'voie pas !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Perso, ça m'dérange pas plus que
ça,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} mais j'doute qu'ça plaise à
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Keine Angst, ich werd das keinem
verraten{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} aber mach das nicht
noch mal!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Auch wenn du Mist verzapft hast,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
hab ich trotzdem was für dich.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bist ja extra hergekommen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sonra bunun hesabını sorarım.
Yine de{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} getirdiğin için sağ ol;
çok işime yaradın! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}E poi me l'hai portato qui così?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Non ci siamo, amico, non ci siamo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I pacchi delle ragazze sono pieni di
segreti{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Aprili{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} e la magia svanisce!
